					"cell_origin": "client",
					"cell_type": "latex_view",
					"source": "As before, the built-in simplification of \\algo{evaluate} is switched off, and\neach result is simplified with \\verb|trigrat|, which for rational functions\nfactorises them and removes vanishing components."
				}
			],
			"hidden": true,
			"source": "As before, the built-in simplification of \\algo{evaluate} is switched off, and\neach result is simplified with \\verb|trigrat|, which for rational functions\nfactorises them and removes vanishing components."
