							"cell_type": "input_form",
							"source": "{g_{t t} = -(-2M r + (a)**2 (y)**2 + (r)**2 + (Q)**2) ((a)**2 (y)**2 + (r)**2)**(-1), g_{t \\phi} = a (y-1) (y + 1) (2M r-(Q)**2) ((a)**2 (y)**2 + (r)**2)**(-1), g_{\\phi t} = a (y-1) (y + 1) (2M r-(Q)**2) ((a)**2 (y)**2 + (r)**2)**(-1), g_{r r} = ((a)**2 (y)**2 + (r)**2) (-2M r + (a)**2 + (r)**2 + (Q)**2)**(-1), g_{y y} = -((a)**2 (y)**2 + (r)**2) ((y-1) (y + 1))**(-1), g_{\\phi \\phi} = -(y-1) (y + 1) (-2M (a)**2 r (y)**2 + 2M (a)**2 r + (a)**4 (y)**2 + (a)**2 (r)**2 (y)**2 + (a)**2 (r)**2 + (a)**2 (Q)**2 (y)**2-(a)**2 (Q)**2 + (r)**4) ((a)**2 (y)**2 + (r)**2)**(-1), g^{t t} = -(-2M (a)**2 r (y)**2 + 2M (a)**2 r + (a)**4 (y)**2 + (a)**2 (r)**2 (y)**2 + (a)**2 (r)**2 + (a)**2 (Q)**2 (y)**2-(a)**2 (Q)**2 + (r)**4) (((a)**2 (y)**2 + (r)**2) (-2M r + (a)**2 + (r)**2 + (Q)**2))**(-1), g^{t \\phi} = -a (2M r-(Q)**2) (((a)**2 (y)**2 + (r)**2) (-2M r + (a)**2 + (r)**2 + (Q)**2))**(-1), g^{r r} = (-2M r + (a)**2 + (r)**2 + (Q)**2) ((a)**2 (y)**2 + (r)**2)**(-1), g^{y y} = -(y-1) (y + 1) ((a)**2 (y)**2 + (r)**2)**(-1), g^{\\phi t} = -a (2M r-(Q)**2) (((a)**2 (y)**2 + (r)**2) (-2M r + (a)**2 + (r)**2 + (Q)**2))**(-1), g^{\\phi \\phi} = -(-2M r + (a)**2 (y)**2 + (r)**2 + (Q)**2) ((y-1) (y + 1) ((a)**2 (y)**2 + (r)**2) (-2M r + (a)**2 + (r)**2 + (Q)**2))**(-1)}"
						}
					],
					"source": "\\begin{dmath*}{}\\left[g_{t t} = -\\frac{\\left(-2\\,M r\\discretionary{}{}{}+{a}^{2\\,} {y}^{2\\,}\\discretionary{}{}{}+{r}^{2\\,}\\discretionary{}{}{}+{Q}^{2\\,}\\right)}{\\left({a}^{2\\,} {y}^{2\\,}\\discretionary{}{}{}+{r}^{2\\,}\\right)}, \\discretionary{}{}{}g_{t \\phi} = \\frac{a \\left(y\\discretionary{}{}{}-\\,1\\right) \\left(y\\discretionary{}{}{}+1\\right) \\left(2\\,M r\\discretionary{}{}{}-\\,{Q}^{2\\,}\\right)}{\\left({a}^{2\\,} {y}^{2\\,}\\discretionary{}{}{}+{r}^{2\\,}\\right)}, \\discretionary{}{}{}g_{\\phi t} = \\frac{a \\left(y\\discretionary{}{}{}-\\,1\\right) \\left(y\\discretionary{}{}{}+1\\right) \\left(2\\,M r\\discretionary{}{}{}-\\,{Q}^{2\\,}\\right)}{\\left({a}^{2\\,} {y}^{2\\,}\\discretionary{}{}{}+{r}^{2\\,}\\right)}, \\discretionary{}{}{}g_{r r} = \\frac{\\left({a}^{2\\,} {y}^{2\\,}\\discretionary{}{}{}+{r}^{2\\,}\\right)}{\\left(-2\\,M r\\discretionary{}{}{}+{a}^{2\\,}\\discretionary{}{}{}+{r}^{2\\,}\\discretionary{}{}{}+{Q}^{2\\,}\\right)}, \\discretionary{}{}{}g_{y y} = -\\frac{\\left({a}^{2\\,} {y}^{2\\,}\\discretionary{}{}{}+{r}^{2\\,}\\right)}{\\left(y\\discretionary{}{}{}-\\,1\\right) \\left(y\\discretionary{}{}{}+1\\right)}, \\discretionary{}{}{}g_{\\phi \\phi} = -\\frac{\\left(y\\discretionary{}{}{}-\\,1\\right) \\left(y\\discretionary{}{}{}+1\\right) \\left(-2\\,M {a}^{2\\,} r {y}^{2\\,}\\discretionary{}{}{}+2\\,M {a}^{2\\,} r\\discretionary{}{}{}+{a}^{4\\,} {y}^{2\\,}\\discretionary{}{}{}+{a}^{2\\,} {r}^{2\\,} {y}^{2\\,}\\discretionary{}{}{}+{a}^{2\\,} {r}^{2\\,}\\discretionary{}{}{}+{a}^{2\\,} {Q}^{2\\,} {y}^{2\\,}\\discretionary{}{}{}-\\,{a}^{2\\,} {Q}^{2\\,}\\discretionary{}{}{}+{r}^{4\\,}\\right)}{\\left({a}^{2\\,} {y}^{2\\,}\\discretionary{}{}{}+{r}^{2\\,}\\right)}, \\discretionary{}{}{}g^{t t} = -\\frac{\\left(-2\\,M {a}^{2\\,} r {y}^{2\\,}\\discretionary{}{}{}+2\\,M {a}^{2\\,} r\\discretionary{}{}{}+{a}^{4\\,} {y}^{2\\,}\\discretionary{}{}{}+{a}^{2\\,} {r}^{2\\,} {y}^{2\\,}\\discretionary{}{}{}+{a}^{2\\,} {r}^{2\\,}\\discretionary{}{}{}+{a}^{2\\,} {Q}^{2\\,} {y}^{2\\,}\\discretionary{}{}{}-\\,{a}^{2\\,} {Q}^{2\\,}\\discretionary{}{}{}+{r}^{4\\,}\\right)}{\\left({a}^{2\\,} {y}^{2\\,}\\discretionary{}{}{}+{r}^{2\\,}\\right) \\left(-2\\,M r\\discretionary{}{}{}+{a}^{2\\,}\\discretionary{}{}{}+{r}^{2\\,}\\discretionary{}{}{}+{Q}^{2\\,}\\right)}, \\discretionary{}{}{}g^{t \\phi} = -\\frac{a \\left(2\\,M r\\discretionary{}{}{}-\\,{Q}^{2\\,}\\right)}{\\left({a}^{2\\,} {y}^{2\\,}\\discretionary{}{}{}+{r}^{2\\,}\\right) \\left(-2\\,M r\\discretionary{}{}{}+{a}^{2\\,}\\discretionary{}{}{}+{r}^{2\\,}\\discretionary{}{}{}+{Q}^{2\\,}\\right)}, \\discretionary{}{}{}g^{r r} = \\frac{\\left(-2\\,M r\\discretionary{}{}{}+{a}^{2\\,}\\discretionary{}{}{}+{r}^{2\\,}\\discretionary{}{}{}+{Q}^{2\\,}\\right)}{\\left({a}^{2\\,} {y}^{2\\,}\\discretionary{}{}{}+{r}^{2\\,}\\right)}, \\discretionary{}{}{}g^{y y} = -\\frac{\\left(y\\discretionary{}{}{}-\\,1\\right) \\left(y\\discretionary{}{}{}+1\\right)}{\\left({a}^{2\\,} {y}^{2\\,}\\discretionary{}{}{}+{r}^{2\\,}\\right)}, \\discretionary{}{}{}g^{\\phi t} = -\\frac{a \\left(2\\,M r\\discretionary{}{}{}-\\,{Q}^{2\\,}\\right)}{\\left({a}^{2\\,} {y}^{2\\,}\\discretionary{}{}{}+{r}^{2\\,}\\right) \\left(-2\\,M r\\discretionary{}{}{}+{a}^{2\\,}\\discretionary{}{}{}+{r}^{2\\,}\\discretionary{}{}{}+{Q}^{2\\,}\\right)}, \\discretionary{}{}{}g^{\\phi \\phi} = -\\frac{\\left(-2\\,M r\\discretionary{}{}{}+{a}^{2\\,} {y}^{2\\,}\\discretionary{}{}{}+{r}^{2\\,}\\discretionary{}{}{}+{Q}^{2\\,}\\right)}{\\left(y\\discretionary{}{}{}-\\,1\\right) \\left(y\\discretionary{}{}{}+1\\right) \\left({a}^{2\\,} {y}^{2\\,}\\discretionary{}{}{}+{r}^{2\\,}\\right) \\left(-2\\,M r\\discretionary{}{}{}+{a}^{2\\,}\\discretionary{}{}{}+{r}^{2\\,}\\discretionary{}{}{}+{Q}^{2\\,}\\right)}\\right]\\end{dmath*}"
