			"source": "rc:= R_{\\sigma\\nu} = R^{\\rho}_{\\sigma\\rho\\nu}:\nsubstitute(rc, rm)\nevaluate(rc, ss, rhsonly=True, simplify=False)\ntrigrat(rc);"
