					"cell_origin": "client",
					"cell_type": "latex_view",
					"source": "The square of the Ricci tensor is $4Q^4/\\Sigma^4$ with\n$\\Sigma = r^2 + a^2 y^2$. (We call it \\verb|Rsq|; a name such as \\verb|RR|\nwould clash with a reserved name in Sympy.)"
				}
			],
			"hidden": true,
			"source": "The square of the Ricci tensor is $4Q^4/\\Sigma^4$ with\n$\\Sigma = r^2 + a^2 y^2$. (We call it \\verb|Rsq|; a name such as \\verb|RR|\nwould clash with a reserved name in Sympy.)"
		},
