			"source": "Rsq:= Rsq = R_{\\mu\\nu} R_{\\rho\\sigma} g^{\\mu\\rho} g^{\\nu\\sigma}:\nsubstitute(Rsq, rc)\nevaluate(Rsq, ss, rhsonly=True, simplify=False)\ntrigrat(Rsq);"
